{"aaData": [["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-appear-1\" title=\"wefün\">wefün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/appear\" title=\"APPEAR [appear]\">APPEAR [appear]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346296240\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1\">V.subj[1] 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-ask-for-1\" title=\"ngillatun\">ngillatun</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/ask-for\" title=\"ASK FOR [ask-for]\">ASK FOR [ask-for]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347398986\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 3 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 3 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-be-a-hunter-1\" title=\"tralkatufengen\">tralkatufengen</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/be-a-hunter\" title=\"BE A HUNTER [be-a-hunter]\">BE A HUNTER [be-a-hunter]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346296240\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1\">V.subj[1] 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-be-dry-1\" title=\"angkün\">angkün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/be-dry\" title=\"BE DRY [be-dry]\">BE DRY [be-dry]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346296240\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1\">V.subj[1] 1</a>", "Verb root means &#x27;get/become dry&#x27;; normally in the resultative aspect to mean &#x27;be (temporarily) dry&#x27; or with -nge &#x27;be&#x27; to mean &#x27;be (always) dry&#x27;."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-be-dry-2\" title=\"ñifün\">ñifün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/be-dry\" title=\"BE DRY [be-dry]\">BE DRY [be-dry]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346296240\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1\">V.subj[1] 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-be-hungry-1\" title=\"ngüñün\">ngüñün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/be-hungry\" title=\"BE HUNGRY [be-hungry]\">BE HUNGRY [be-hungry]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346296240\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1\">V.subj[1] 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-be-ill-1\" title=\"kutranün\">kutranün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/be-ill\" title=\"BE ILL [be-ill]\">BE ILL [be-ill]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346296240\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1\">V.subj[1] 1</a>", "The verb root means &#x27;get/become ill&#x27;; it normally appears in the resultative aspect to mean &#x27;be ill&#x27;."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-be-sad-1\" title=\"lladkün\">lladkün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/be-sad\" title=\"BE SAD [be-sad]\">BE SAD [be-sad]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346296240\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1\">V.subj[1] 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-beat-1\" title=\"trawawtrawawtun\">trawawtrawawtun</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/beat\" title=\"BEAT [beat]\">BEAT [beat]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346375907\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1 3+mew\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1 3+mew</a>", "Reduplicated (=iterative) version of trawawün &#x27;hit&#x27;."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-blink-1\" title=\"llüpifün\">llüpifün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/blink\" title=\"BLINK [blink]\">BLINK [blink]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346296240\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1\">V.subj[1] 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-boil-1\" title=\"afün\">afün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/boil\" title=\"BOIL [boil]\">BOIL [boil]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346296240\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1\">V.subj[1] 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-break-1\" title=\"watron\">watron</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/break\" title=\"BREAK [break]\">BREAK [break]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346375907\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1 3+mew\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1 3+mew</a>", "Watron is ambitransitive/labile, like English break."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-break-2\" title=\"trafon\">trafon</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/break\" title=\"BREAK [break]\">BREAK [break]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346375907\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1 3+mew\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1 3+mew</a>", "Trafon is ambitransitive/labile, like English break."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-bring-1\" title=\"küpalelün\">küpalelün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/bring\" title=\"BRING [bring]\">BRING [bring]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347398986\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 3 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 3 1</a>", "This is the (high-control) causativized version of küpan &#x27;come&#x27;; the verb küpalün &#x27;bring&#x27; must be applicativized in order to become ditransitive."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-build-1\" title=\"dewman\">dewman</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/build\" title=\"BUILD [build]\">BUILD [build]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", "The semantics is more general, viz. &#x27;make, conclude, realize, etc.&#x27; Originally dew-ma- [make-APPL2-], dewün &#x27;get/be finished&#x27; is obsolescent, (low-control) causativized dew-üm- [make-CAUS2-] presently equivalent to dewma-."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-burn-1\" title=\"lüfün\">lüfün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/burn\" title=\"BURN [burn]\">BURN [burn]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346296240\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1\">V.subj[1] 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-carry-1\" title=\"yen\">yen</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/carry\" title=\"CARRY [carry]\">CARRY [carry]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346375907\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1 3+mew\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1 3+mew</a>", "The verb is transitive (A+T) and has to be applicativized via APPL1 to accommodate an R participant."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-climb-1\" title=\"wechun\">wechun</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/climb\" title=\"CLIMB [climb]\">CLIMB [climb]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347428233\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1 2+mew\">V.subj[1] 1 2+mew</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-cook-1\" title=\"afümün\">afümün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/cook\" title=\"COOK [cook]\">COOK [cook]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", "It is the (low-control) causative of afün &#x27;cook (itr.)&#x27;; the high-control causative afülün has the same meaning."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-cough-1\" title=\"chafon\">chafon</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/cough\" title=\"COUGH [cough]\">COUGH [cough]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346296240\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1\">V.subj[1] 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-cover-1\" title=\"takun\">takun</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/cover\" title=\"COVER [cover]\">COVER [cover]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-cry-1\" title=\"ngüman\">ngüman</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/cry\" title=\"CRY [cry]\">CRY [cry]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346296240\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1\">V.subj[1] 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-cut-1\" title=\"katrün\">katrün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/cut\" title=\"CUT [cut]\">CUT [cut]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346375907\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1 3+mew\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1 3+mew</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-die-1\" title=\"l̠an\">l̠an</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/die\" title=\"DIE [die]\">DIE [die]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346296240\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1\">V.subj[1] 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-dig-1\" title=\"rüngan\">rüngan</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/dig\" title=\"DIG [dig]\">DIG [dig]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346296240\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1\">V.subj[1] 1</a>", "&#x27;for X&#x27; requires a second V in non finite form."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-dress-1\" title=\"takun\">takun</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/dress\" title=\"DRESS [dress]\">DRESS [dress]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", "It originally means &#x27;cover&#x27;."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-eat-1\" title=\"in\">in</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/eat\" title=\"EAT [eat]\">EAT [eat]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", "This verb is ambitransitive/labile, like English eat."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-fall-1\" title=\"tranün\">tranün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/fall\" title=\"FALL [fall]\">FALL [fall]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347428233\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1 2+mew\">V.subj[1] 1 2+mew</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-fear-1\" title=\"llükan\">llükan</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/fear\" title=\"FEAR [fear]\">FEAR [fear]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", "It is not clear how ambitransitive/labile this verb really is; it is sometimes found as monovalent."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-feel-cold-1\" title=\"wütren\">wütren</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/feel-cold\" title=\"FEEL COLD [feel-cold]\">FEEL COLD [feel-cold]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346296240\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1\">V.subj[1] 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-feel-pain-1\" title=\"kutran-n\">kutran-n</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/feel-pain\" title=\"FEEL PAIN [feel-pain]\">FEEL PAIN [feel-pain]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346296240\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1\">V.subj[1] 1</a>", "V PSR=E SUBJ=M"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-fill-1\" title=\"apolün\">apolün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/fill\" title=\"FILL [fill]\">FILL [fill]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346375907\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1 3+mew\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1 3+mew</a>", "It is the (high-control) causative of apon &#x27;fill (intr.)&#x27;; applicativized apo-ñma- means &#x27;be pregnant&#x27;."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-follow-1\" title=\"inan\">inan</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/follow\" title=\"FOLLOW [follow]\">FOLLOW [follow]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", "Doubly applicativized ina-l-tu- means &#x27;follow along the banks&#x27;."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-frighten-1\" title=\"trupefülün\">trupefülün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/frighten\" title=\"FRIGHTEN [frighten]\">FRIGHTEN [frighten]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", "It is (high-control) causative of trupefü- &#x27;be frightened&#x27;."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-get-2\" title=\"tun\">tun</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/get\" title=\"GET [get]\">GET [get]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", "[X mew] is possible but possible unidiomatic; elun &#x27;give&#x27; is preferred."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-get-1\" title=\"llowün\">llowün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/get\" title=\"GET [get]\">GET [get]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", "(From X) requires ma-applicativization; the primary object is then X."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-give-1\" title=\"elun\">elun</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/give\" title=\"GIVE [give]\">GIVE [give]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347398986\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 3 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 3 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-go-1\" title=\"amun\">amun</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/go\" title=\"GO [go]\">GO [go]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347428233\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1 2+mew\">V.subj[1] 1 2+mew</a>", "Amu-tu- &#x27;go away&#x27; is not an applicative."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-grind-1\" title=\"müḻan\">müḻan</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/grind\" title=\"GRIND [grind]\">GRIND [grind]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-hear-1\" title=\"allkün\">allkün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/hear\" title=\"HEAR [hear]\">HEAR [hear]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", "Allkü-tu- means &#x27;listen to&#x27; and is not an applicative."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-help-1\" title=\"kellun\">kellun</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/help\" title=\"HELP [help]\">HELP [help]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-hide-1\" title=\"llumümün\">llumümün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/hide\" title=\"HIDE [hide]\">HIDE [hide]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", "It is the (low-control) causative of llum- &#x27;hide (intr.)&#x27;."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-hit-1\" title=\"trawawün\">trawawün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/hit\" title=\"HIT [hit]\">HIT [hit]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346375907\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1 3+mew\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1 3+mew</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-hug-1\" title=\"rofülün\">rofülün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/hug\" title=\"HUG [hug]\">HUG [hug]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-jump-1\" title=\"rüngkün\">rüngkün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/jump\" title=\"JUMP [jump]\">JUMP [jump]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347428233\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1 2+mew\">V.subj[1] 1 2+mew</a>", "Rüngkü-tu- &#x27;jump and seize (tr.)&#x27; is not an applicative."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-kill-1\" title=\"l̠angümün\">l̠angümün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/kill\" title=\"KILL [kill]\">KILL [kill]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346375907\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1 3+mew\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1 3+mew</a>", "It is an irregular (low-control) causative of lan &#x27;die&#x27;"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-know-1\" title=\"kimün\">kimün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/know\" title=\"KNOW [know]\">KNOW [know]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-laugh-1\" title=\"ayen\">ayen</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/laugh\" title=\"LAUGH [laugh]\">LAUGH [laugh]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346296240\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1\">V.subj[1] 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-leave-1\" title=\"püntun\">püntun</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/leave\" title=\"LEAVE [leave]\">LEAVE [leave]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347428233\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1 2+mew\">V.subj[1] 1 2+mew</a>", "A became separate (from L)."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-like-1\" title=\"kümentun\">kümentun</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/like\" title=\"LIKE [like]\">LIKE [like]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-like-2\" title=\"ayün\">ayün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/like\" title=\"LIKE [like]\">LIKE [like]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", "Ayü-tu- &#x27;love again&#x27; is not an applicative."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-live-1\" title=\"mülen\">mülen</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/live\" title=\"LIVE [live]\">LIVE [live]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347428233\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1 2+mew\">V.subj[1] 1 2+mew</a>", "Müle-tu- &#x27;be again, become restored&#x27; is not an applicative"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-load-1\" title=\"chechümün\">chechümün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/load\" title=\"LOAD [load]\">LOAD [load]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346375907\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1 3+mew\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1 3+mew</a>", "A loads L (with T)."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-look-at-1\" title=\"lelin\">lelin</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/look-at\" title=\"LOOK AT [look-at]\">LOOK AT [look-at]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-look-at-2\" title=\"adkintun\">adkintun</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/look-at\" title=\"LOOK AT [look-at]\">LOOK AT [look-at]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-make-1\" title=\"dewman\">dewman</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/make\" title=\"MAKE [make]\">MAKE [make]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346375907\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1 3+mew\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1 3+mew</a>", "Cf. dewman (1)"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-meet-1\" title=\"trafün\">trafün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/meet\" title=\"MEET [meet]\">MEET [meet]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346296240\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1\">V.subj[1] 1</a>", "The bivalent coding frame (ex. 137) is dispreferred and even rejected by some speakers."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-name-1\" title=\"üytuntukun\">üytuntukun</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/name\" title=\"NAME [name]\">NAME [name]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", "without APPL1: &#x27;name (sth.)&#x27; (=üytun); with APPL1 (or also üy-tu-n-tuku- [name(n.)-take-NFIN-put-]): &#x27;give X (OBJ) the name Y&#x27;"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-peel-1\" title=\"chafün\">chafün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/peel\" title=\"PEEL [peel]\">PEEL [peel]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-play-1\" title=\"awkantun\">awkantun</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/play\" title=\"PLAY [play]\">PLAY [play]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346296240\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1\">V.subj[1] 1</a>", "This verb is ambitransitive/labile (the object is the person or animal, marginally also the thing played with)."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-pour-1\" title=\"wütruntukun\">wütruntukun</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/pour\" title=\"POUR [pour]\">POUR [pour]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346375907\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1 3+mew\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1 3+mew</a>", "It is polymorphemic: wütru- &#x27;pour, melt (tr.)&#x27; and tuku- &#x27;put&#x27;."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-push-1\" title=\"pelün\">pelün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/push\" title=\"PUSH [push]\">PUSH [push]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", "[L mew] is possible but possibly unidiomatic."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-put-1\" title=\"elün\">elün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/put\" title=\"PUT [put]\">PUT [put]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346375907\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1 3+mew\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1 3+mew</a>", "El-tu- &#x27;put again, restore&#x27; is not an applicative."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-rain-1\" title=\"mawüṉün\">mawüṉün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/rain\" title=\"RAIN [rain]\">RAIN [rain]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/7549445631\" title=\"V.subj[0]\">V.subj[0]</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-roll-1\" title=\"imülün\">imülün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/roll\" title=\"ROLL [roll]\">ROLL [roll]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346296240\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1\">V.subj[1] 1</a>", "Imül-tu- &#x27;roll about (itr.)&#x27; is not an applicative."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-run-1\" title=\"lefün\">lefün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/run\" title=\"RUN [run]\">RUN [run]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346296240\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1\">V.subj[1] 1</a>", "Lef-ye- &#x27;flee with&#x27; is not an applicative."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-say-1\" title=\"pin\">pin</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/say\" title=\"SAY [say]\">SAY [say]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347398986\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 3 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 3 1</a>", "Typically, the quote precedes pin and follows feypin.; some speakers use pin in both positions."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-scream-1\" title=\"wirarün\">wirarün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/scream\" title=\"SCREAM [scream]\">SCREAM [scream]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346296240\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1\">V.subj[1] 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-search-for-1\" title=\"kintun\">kintun</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/search-for\" title=\"SEARCH FOR [search-for]\">SEARCH FOR [search-for]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-see-1\" title=\"pen\">pen</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/see\" title=\"SEE [see]\">SEE [see]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-send-1\" title=\"amulün\">amulün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/send\" title=\"SEND [send]\">SEND [send]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346375907\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1 3+mew\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1 3+mew</a>", "Cf. amun &#x27;go&#x27;"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-shave-self-1\" title=\"payuntun\">payuntun</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/shave-self\" title=\"SHAVE (self) [shave-self]\">SHAVE (self) [shave-self]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346296240\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1\">V.subj[1] 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-shout-at-1\" title=\"wirarün\">wirarün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/shout-at\" title=\"SHOUT AT [shout-at]\">SHOUT AT [shout-at]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", "The verb is labile/ambitransitive, cf. wirarün (2)."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-show-1\" title=\"pengelün\">pengelün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/show\" title=\"SHOW [show]\">SHOW [show]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347398986\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 3 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 3 1</a>", "It seems to be originally polymorphemic: pe- &#x27;see&#x27; + -nge PASS + -l APPL1, but the linear order of the elements is anomalous."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-sing-1\" title=\"ülkantun\">ülkantun</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/sing\" title=\"SING [sing]\">SING [sing]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346296240\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1\">V.subj[1] 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-sink-1\" title=\"lanün\">lanün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/sink\" title=\"SINK [sink]\">SINK [sink]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346296240\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1\">V.subj[1] 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-sit-down-1\" title=\"anün\">anün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/sit-down\" title=\"SIT DOWN [sit-down]\">SIT DOWN [sit-down]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347428233\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1 2+mew\">V.subj[1] 1 2+mew</a>", "Anü-tu- &#x27;sit down again&#x27; is not an applicative. The meaning &#x27;be sitting&#x27; needs the resultative aspect of this verb; the unmarked form means &#x27;sit down&#x27;."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-sit-1\" title=\"anün\">anün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/sit\" title=\"SIT [sit]\">SIT [sit]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347428233\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1 2+mew\">V.subj[1] 1 2+mew</a>", "Anü-tu- &#x27;sit down again&#x27; is not an applicative. The meaning &#x27;be sitting&#x27; needs the resultative aspect of this verb; the unmarked form means &#x27;sit down&#x27;."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-smell-1\" title=\"ṉümütun\">ṉümütun</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/smell\" title=\"SMELL [smell]\">SMELL [smell]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", "Ṉümün is &#x27;smell (itr.)&#x27;; the transitive verb is applicativized with tu-; nümü-l- means &#x27;sprinkle with smelling substances&#x27;."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-steal-1\" title=\"weñen\">weñen</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/steal\" title=\"STEAL [steal]\">STEAL [steal]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-take-2\" title=\"tun\">tun</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/take\" title=\"TAKE [take]\">TAKE [take]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", "&#x27;from X&#x27; requires APPL2: V.subj.obj1 (Obj1=X) (Obj2=P) (Subj)."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-take-1\" title=\"nün\">nün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/take\" title=\"TAKE [take]\">TAKE [take]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", "&#x27;from X&#x27; requires APPL2: V.subj.obj1 (Obj1=X) (Obj2=P) (Subj)."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-talk-1\" title=\"ngütramkan\">ngütramkan</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/talk\" title=\"TALK [talk]\">TALK [talk]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", "APPL -lel: Obj=X (Y PPOS); APPL -ye: Obj=Y (X PPOS)"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-teach-1\" title=\"kimelün\">kimelün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/teach\" title=\"TEACH [teach]\">TEACH [teach]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347398986\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 3 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 3 1</a>", "(High-control) causative of kimün &#x27;know&#x27;."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-tear-1\" title=\"kacharnentun\">kacharnentun</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/tear\" title=\"TEAR [tear]\">TEAR [tear]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-tell-1\" title=\"ngütramün\">ngütramün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/tell\" title=\"TELL [tell]\">TELL [tell]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", "&#x27;X&#x27; requires APPL1."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-think-1\" title=\"rakiduamün\">rakiduamün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/think\" title=\"THINK [think]\">THINK [think]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347428233\" title=\"V.subj[1] 1 2+mew\">V.subj[1] 1 2+mew</a>", "&#x27;about X&#x27; requires [X PPOS] or APPL4, the verb is basically monovalent (but cf. Labile Alternation)."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-throw-1\" title=\"ütrüfün\">ütrüfün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/throw\" title=\"THROW [throw]\">THROW [throw]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", "APPL3 can swap between OBJ and ADJ or increase valency (OBJ1 + OBJ2)."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-tie-2\" title=\"trapelün\">trapelün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/tie\" title=\"TIE [tie]\">TIE [tie]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", "&#x27;Tie P to L&#x27; requires a more complex verb trapel-tuku- (&#x27;tie-put-&#x27;)."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-tie-1\" title=\"trarün\">trarün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/tie\" title=\"TIE [tie]\">TIE [tie]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", "The instrument might be expressed via a mew-phrase if L is missing, but not idiomatic; biclausal strategy preferred (&#x27;A takes I and/to tie P to L&#x27;)."], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-touch-1\" title=\"kachillman\">kachillman</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/touch\" title=\"TOUCH [touch]\">TOUCH [touch]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6346375907\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1 3+mew\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1 3+mew</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-want-1\" title=\"ayün\">ayün</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/want\" title=\"WANT [want]\">WANT [want]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", "Cf. ayün (2)"], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-wash-1\" title=\"küchan\">küchan</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/wash\" title=\"WASH [wash]\">WASH [wash]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", ""], ["<a class=\"Value\" href=\"https://valpal.info/values/mapu1245-wipe-1\" title=\"liftun\">liftun</a>", "<a class=\"Parameter\" href=\"https://valpal.info/parameters/wipe\" title=\"WIPE [wipe]\">WIPE [wipe]</a>", "<a class=\"CodingFrame\" href=\"https://valpal.info/codingframes/6347700008\" title=\"V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1\">V.subj[1].obj[2] 2 1</a>", "V X A, i.e. T is omitted."]], "sEcho": "1", "iTotalRecords": 94, "iTotalDisplayRecords": 94}